# === OS / editor cruft ===
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/

# === Secrets / local env — never commit ===
# This project handles an at-rest encryption key ("identity capsule").
# Keep keys and env files out of history by default.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12

# === Local scratch & logs ===
/scratch/
# Session scratch used during M1 spikes/dev (keypair working files, extracted
# chrome, .deb, profiles — hundreds of MB). Keep out of history; the private
# .pem is also covered by *.pem above, but the dir must never be `git add`-ed.
/scratchpad/
*.log

# === Build artifacts (Rust workspace, G1/D15) ===
/target/
**/target/
/dist/

# Node deps and caches, ANYWHERE in the tree. crates/extension-dist/.gitignore
# already covers its own; this rule exists because running vitest from the wrong
# working directory drops a stray `node_modules/.vite` cache at the repo ROOT,
# where nothing was ignoring it (seen 2026-07-27).
node_modules/

# === Generated docs (never commit — regenerate via `cargo xtask docs`) ===
# Rust docs land in /target/doc/, already covered by /target/ above.
/crates/extension-dist/api-docs/

# Ignore execution progress tracking files from the superpowers skill - considered ephemeral
.superpowers/
